    {
      "id": "claim_2f3c4962746b4799ac90ca4ff0eaaf91",
      "statement": "The `Diagram` component renders with the measured container width (`maxWidth`) and a `directionBreakpoint` of 760, so wide left-to-right flows flip to top-down in the narrow side panel.",
