      "id": "claim_9f583d5a63824da3864084c9df814ecf",
      "statement": "`diagramError` converts a Pele failure into a model-readable message that names the Pele error code and, when known, the line, the column and a short snippet of the offending source; it returns null when the diagram renders.",
