    {
      "id": "claim_0c55640796f444fc9b508815b154d833",
      "statement": "`validateDiagrams` walks the parsed program tree, renders every `Diagram` element that has a `mermaid` prop, and returns one error per failing diagram prefixed with the statement id, so a broken Mermaid source reaches the model's repair turn.",
