    {
      "id": "claim_30f6623eb726434a8b067189187acb16",
      "statement": "The prompt rules (`DIAGRAM_RULES`, injected into both the summary and the Q&A prompt) restrict diagrams to process, decision, sequence, lifecycle, mindmap and ER structures, cap them at one per summary, and forbid using a diagram for plain lists or numbers.",
